rtising & Sponsorship"},{"text":"Celebrity Interviewing"},{"text":"Digital Audio"},{"text":"Audience Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radio/media internship"},{"text":"Live show practice"},{"text":"Podcast series"},{"text":"RJ demo reel"},{"text":"Interview project"},{"text":"Final audio-production project"},{"text":"Portfolio development"}]}]},{"heading":"Voice & Speech Training","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Voice is the primary professional tool of an RJ."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Voice clarity"},{"text":"Pronunciation"},{"text":"Diction"},{"text":"Articulation"},{"text":"Pace"},{"text":"Pitch"},{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Volume"},{"text":"Pausing"},{"text":"Breathing"},{"text":"Vocal stamina"},{"text":"Emotional expression"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Daily Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tongue twisters"},{"text":"Newspaper/news reading"},{"text":"Script reading"},{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Character/voice exercises"},{"text":"Breathing exercises"},{"text":"Recorded self-review"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is natural, understandable and engaging delivery, not an artificially exaggerated voice."}]},{"heading":"Regional Language Mastery","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For regional-language RJs, develop exceptional command of the chosen language."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grammar"},{"text":"Vocabulary"},{"text":"Pronunciation"},{"text":"Idioms"},{"text":"Colloquial speech"},{"text":"Literature"},{"text":"Cultural references"},{"text":"Local dialect awareness"},{"text":"Formal vs informal language"},{"text":"Code-switching where appropriate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example, a Telugu RJ may need to comfortably move between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Standard Telugu","conversational Telugu","appropriate English/Hinglish-style expressions"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"without compromising clarity."}]},{"heading":"Radio Presentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how a professional radio segment works."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Show Opening","Greeting","Topic","Music/Content","Commentary","Interaction","Break","Segment","Interview","Closing"]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Show openings"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Introductions"},{"text":"Music links"},{"text":"Topic discussions"},{"text":"Listener interaction"},{"text":"Contest announcements"},{"text":"Sponsor mentions"},{"text":"Closing segments"}]}]},{"heading":"RJ Scriptwriting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Write scripts that sound spoken, not like essays."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hooks"},{"text":"Conversational writing"},{"text":"Short sentences"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Humour"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Questions"},{"text":"Audience prompts"},{"text":"Sponsor integration"},{"text":"Call-to-action"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example Structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hook","Story","Opinion/Observation","Listener Question","Interaction","Transition"]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice writing scripts for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"30-second links"},{"text":"2-minute segments"},{"text":"5-minute discussions"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Advertisements"},{"text":"Show openings"},{"text":"Show closings"}]}]},{"heading":"Improvisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Live radio often requires thinking quickly."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spontaneous speaking"},{"text":"Topic expansion"},{"text":"Quick transitions"},{"text":"Recovery from mistakes"},{"text":"Audience interaction"},{"text":"Humour"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Question generation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice speaking for 1–3 minutes on a random topic without reading a script."}]},{"heading":"Interviewing Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"RJs often interview:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Actors"},{"text":"Musicians"},{"text":"Authors"},{"text":"Entrepreneurs"},{"text":"Sports personalities"},{"text":"Experts"},{"text":"Social leaders"},{"text":"Creators"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research before interview"},{"text":"Question design"},{"text":"Follow-up questions"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Timing"},{"text":"Fact checking"},{"text":"Conversational flow"},{"text":"Closing questions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid asking a sequence of disconnected questions. A strong interview should feel like a conversation."}]},{"heading":"Radio Programming","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand how radio shows are designed."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Breakfast shows"},{"text":"Drive-time shows"},{"text":"Music shows"},{"text":"Talk shows"},{"text":"News programmes"},{"text":"Youth programming"},{"text":"Community radio"},{"text":"Specialty shows"},{"text":"Weekend programming"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Show positioning"},{"text":"Segment design"},{"text":"Timing"},{"text":"Music/content balance"},{"text":"Audience interaction"},{"text":"Programming schedule"}]}]},{"heading":"Audio Production","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An RJ should understand the production process."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microphones"},{"text":"Recording"},{"text":"Gain"},{"text":"Noise"},{"text":"EQ"},{"text":"Compression"},{"text":"Reverb"},{"text":"Voice processing"},{"text":"Music mixing"},{"text":"Sound effects"},{"text":"Audio levels"},{"text":"File formats"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Audio Editing"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cutting"},{"text":"Trimming"},{"text":"Noise reduction"},{"text":"Volume normalization"},{"text":"Music mixing"},{"text":"Voice cleanup"},{"text":"Fade in/out"},{"text":"Background music"},{"text":"Exporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful software:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audacity"},{"text":"Adobe Audition"},{"text":"Reaper"},{"text":"DAWs such as GarageBand where available"}]}]},{"heading":"Podcasting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Podcasting is an important parallel career path."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Podcast concept"},{"text":"Audience definition"},{"text":"Episode planning"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Scripting"},{"text":"Recording"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Publishing"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Promotion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create different formats:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solo podcast"},{"text":"Interview podcast"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"News/current-affairs discussion"},{"text":"Regional-language educational content"}]}]},{"heading":"Digital Content & Social Media","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern RJs often need to extend their personality beyond radio."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Podcast platforms"},{"text":"Social-media storytelling"},{"text":"Audience engagement"},{"text":"Content calendars"},{"text":"Community management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to convert:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Radio Segment","Short Video","Social Post","Podcast Episode"]}]},{"heading":"Audience Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Listeners"},{"text":"Downloads"},{"text":"Watch time"},{"text":"Completion rate"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Followers"},{"text":"Subscriber growth"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Click-through rate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Platform analytics"},{"text":"Power BI basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The purpose is to understand which content audiences actually consume, not simply chase vanity metrics."}]},{"heading":"Advertising & Brand Integration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"RJs may work with advertisers and sponsors."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radio advertising"},{"text":"Commercial scripts"},{"text":"Sponsorship"},{"text":"Brand mentions"},{"text":"Branded segments"},{"text":"Contest promotions"},{"text":"Event promotion"},{"text":"Client briefs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Editorial content","Sponsored content","Advertisement"]},{"type":"p","text":"and maintain appropriate disclosure and editorial standards."}]},{"heading":"Journalism & Current Affairs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An RJ should have broad awareness."},{"type":"p","text":"Follow:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"National news"},{"text":"Regional news"},{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Sports"},{"text":"Entertainment"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Social issues"},{"text":"Local events"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source verification"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Avoiding rumours"},{"text":"Responsible reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For news-related broadcasting, accuracy and verification are essential."}]},{"heading":"Media Ethics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Fairness"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Defamation awareness"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Source protection"},{"text":"Advertising disclosure"},{"text":"Responsible language"},{"text":"Misinformation"},{"text":"Manipulated media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Be particularly careful with unverified claims involving individuals."}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — 10-Episode Regional-Language Podcast"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a podcast series in the chosen language."},{"type":"p","text":"Each episode should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Intro"},{"text":"Main segment"},{"text":"Outro"},{"text":"Audio editing"},{"text":"Cover art"},{"text":"Episode description"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Complete Radio Show Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a 30-minute radio show containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Opening"},{"text":"Music introduction"},{"text":"Topic discussion"},{"text":"Listener interaction"},{"text":"Advertisement simulation"},{"text":"Interview"},{"text":"Transition"},{"text":"Closing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a polished demo."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Celebrity/Expert Interview"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a subject-matter expert or public creator and conduct a recorded interview."},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pre-interview research"},{"text":"Questions"},{"text":"Follow-ups"},{"text":"Listening"},{"text":"Voice control"},{"text":"Editing"}]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Regional Digital Radio & Podcast Channel"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete digital audio brand."},{"type":"h","text":"Components"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brand","Target Audience","Show Concept","Episodes","RJ Presentation","Podcast","Social Media","Audience Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Deliverables"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Channel identity"},{"text":"10–15 episode podcast"},{"text":"30-minute RJ demo"},{"text":"Interview episode"},{"text":"News/current-affairs segment"},{"text":"Audio advertisement"},{"text":"Social-media content"},{"text":"Content calendar"},{"text":"Audience analytics dashboard"},{"text":"Final portfolio"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demon